(title_block (title "Coprocessor") (date "2026-10-25") (rev "A") (company "The OpenDAP Project") (comment 1 "blk.rp2354") (comment 2 "RP2354A orchestration coprocessor, drawn on two sub-sheets"))
(lib_symbols )
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: RP2354A orchestration coprocessor (BRD-014, should); flashed by Blackbird OS over\n   SWD or USB BOOTSEL (BRD-015); never in a data path (BRD-005); the SoC boots without it (BRD-019).\n2. Absent state: unfitted or RP_PWR_EN low: rails off; RP_IRQ low (no wake); UART, SWD and RUN\n   parked low by the SoC; the I2S taps reach FT pads only (3.63 V at IOVDD 0 V, G4).\n3. Drawn on two sub-sheets (blk.rp2354-core, blk.rp2354-power) holding the units of one part." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 144.78 0) (size 129.54 16.51) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6cce56e5-45f7-586c-afd6-4e5a87a6ed4a"))
